{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"11":{"eng-name":"The Rites of Hajj (Kitab Al-Manasik Wa'l-Hajj)","ara-name":"كتاب المناسك"}},"section_detail":{"11":{"hadithnumber_first":1721,"hadithnumber_last":2045,"arabicnumber_first":1721,"arabicnumber_last":2045}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1977,"arabicnumber":1977,"text":"AbuMijlaz a dit : J’ai interrogé Ibn Abbas au sujet du lancer de pierres sur les jamrahs. Il a répondu : Je ne sais pas si le Messager d’Allah ﷺ a lancé six ou sept cailloux","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":11,"hadith":257},"chapter":{"id":78,"ara-name":"باب فِي رَمْىِ الْجِمَارِ","eng-name":"Regarding Stoning The Jimar","isFirstHadith":false}}]}